                "Tantalate-Lode TL-HIL has sodium-reduction retort RT-2 rattling on the electrode "
                "puck, well above the quiet band. Coil CT remains under its own cap and would have "
                "authorized a 12 MW slip if AE had lost the race. Holding the slip is the only legal "
                "gate; mock-pit amps do not license a growling sodium-reducer electrode.",